  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Alternative entry paths",
      "items": [
        "The direct POST returns an enrollment profile after admission. GET enters web authentication only when WebAuth is configured.",
        "The browser callback may reach another replica. Shared state retains the original CMS and validated signer with the original serial, UDID and browser-grant expiration; consumption is atomic and one-use.",
        "The reference server applies its configured enrollment policy before profile issuance. A policy denial returns HTTP 403; unavailable backend state remains HTTP 500."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "authentication",
      "title": "Trust and activation",
      "items": [
        "The profile\u2019s HTTPS anchors are independent of its SCEP or ACME identity issuer. Stable identifiers support later controlled replacement.",
        "The device obtains its identity certificate before Authenticate. TokenUpdate supplies push details and enables the enrollment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "failure",
      "title": "Update-required outcome",
      "items": [
        "Literal configured versions apply to iOS, iPadOS, macOS and visionOS. Current devices proceed; capable older devices receive the supported update response. Unknown or incapable required targets fail explicitly. No tvOS gate or dynamic latest-version policy is configured."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
